.TH git-harvest-id-inherit 1  "inherit " 
.SH NAME
git\-harvest\-id\-inherit \- Register the identity from the local Git configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit\-harvest id inherit\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register the identity from the local Git configuration.
.PP
Reads `user.name` and `user.email` from the repository\*(Aqs local Git configuration and registers that identity proactively, rather than waiting for it to be discovered the first time `scan` harvests one of its commits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
